# Git on Windows rewrites line endings in anything it guesses is text. Its guess
# is a heuristic, and a font or an icon that gets CRLF'd is corrupt in a way that
# looks like a mysterious runtime bug rather than a checkout problem. Be explicit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.zip   binary
*.exe   binary
*.dmg   binary
